{{! Class-level constraints, for cross-field rules OpenAPI cannot express. Unlike
    additionalModelTypeAnnotations — which is global to every model in the task — this is keyed on
    the individual schema. The value is a fully-qualified annotation name written without its
    leading '@', and rendered with no argument list — so the annotation's members must all have
    defaults. Supporting a constraint with a mandatory attribute means extending this block to
    carry arguments. See x-klabis-class-constraint in the klabis-api-spec skill. }}
